`LoomReDriveReactor` subscribes to `streamDomainEvents`, debounces on `thread.outcome-set | thread.route-taken | thread.archived | thread.unarchived | thread.deleted | thread.goal-set` **and on a terminal `run.updated`** (so a deferred gate leg is retried when its target's run ends, not when some unrelated event happens by), runs the pass, and runs once at startup.

